        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The County agrees to provide a minimum statutory disability insurance plan registered with the State of New York to all employees covered under this Agreement who have served continuously for four consecutive weeks. The County will provide said coverage commencing November 1, 1996 containing the following benefits:",
