        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Employees will not earn vacation, sick leave nor personal leave credits while receiving just disability benefits. Employees will earn one-half (1/2) a vacation day and one-half (1/2) sick leave day while receiving disability benefits, if they are on the active payroll for more than one-half (1/2) of the work days in any given month. The employee will be considered to have no interruption of service while receiving benefits.",
